        "type": "abstract",
        "title": "Purpose",
        "body": "This is the **physical instantiation of the [[Zimmerman's-Cyclical-SRL-Model|SRL feedback loop]]** — the node where the outputs of [[Self-Reflection-Phase|Self-Reflection]] become the inputs of the next [[Forethought-Phase|Forethought Phase]]. Open this note BEFORE the Forethought template at the start of every reading session. Update it AFTER every Self-Reflection session. See [[Adaptive-Inference]] and [[Strategic-Planning]].",
        "line_number": 23,
        "source": "SRL-Living-Learning-Agenda.md",
        "char_start": 550,
        "char_end": 1006
      },
      {
        "type": "warning",
        "title": "Consult Before Every Forethought Session",
        "body": "The value of this document depends entirely on it being *actively consulted*, not merely maintained. If you skip reviewing this before a session, the feedback loop is structurally open.",
        "line_number": 26,
        "source": "SRL-Living-Learning-Agenda.md",
        "char_start": 1007,
        "char_end": 1249
      },
      {
        "type": "connections-and-links",
        "title": "Untitled",
        "body": "**PKB Connections:**\n- [[Zimmerman's-Cyclical-SRL-Model]] — This note IS the feedback loop, instantiated as a PKB document\n- [[Forethought-Phase]] — Consult this note at the START of every Forethought session\n- [[Self-Reflection-Phase]] — Update this note at the END of every Self-Reflection session\n- [[Adaptive-Inference]] — The carry-forward queue holds active adaptive inferences\n- [[Strategic-Planning]] — The strategy development log tracks strategic knowledge growth\n- [[Metacognitive-Regulation]] — This note externalizes the regulation function\n- [[Deliberate-Practice]] — The progressive goal log demonstrates the deliberate practice trajectory\n- [[SRL-Calibration-Log]] — Companion tracking document for calibration metrics",
        "line_number": 183,
        "source": "SRL-Living-Learning-Agenda.md",
        "char_start": 6387,
        "char_end": 7167
      }
